   fix can re-use its fixtures.

## Common fixes

- **Input validation.** Many bugs in
  {{ title | lower }} are actually bad inputs passed from
  outside. Validate types and ranges at the boundary before
  blaming internals.
- **Stale cache or state.** If the code worked yesterday
  but fails today without a code change, suspect caches,
  lockfiles, or environment drift.
- **Version mismatch.** A dependency upgrade can change
  behavior. Run `pip show <dep>` to confirm the installed
  version matches expectations.

